- Entering volume edit stops an active Preview first so the large music WAV is never rewritten while it is playing.
- ON/OFF changes remain stored in SOUND.CFG and are applied immediately. The game still skips disabled sounds entirely.
- Volume 0 remains silent.
- Pip.setVol remains fixed at normal Pip-Boy master volume during gameplay/card effects, preventing background-music pumping.
