- Removed CARAVAN_CPU as a dynamically evaluated module entirely. Ringo now uses a compact inline, allocation-light greedy move picker with the same Caravan play legality rules and lightweight sold/bust/face-card heuristics.
- Eliminated the CPU API object/module closure and all CPU eval/defrag startup pauses.
