- Overlap SFX remain 8 kHz mono IMA-ADPCM and continue over Lazy Days Tired without stopping/restarting the music.
- Ringo think time reduced from 3-7 seconds to about 1.5-3 seconds.
- Startup is now: renderer -> decks/hands -> 6-byte sound config -> board -> controls -> music on next event-loop turn. There is no CPU preload and no audio-module eval after the board appears.
- Managed SOUND.CFG uninstall cleanup, Volume 0-15, preview sounds, music credit, game rules, board layout, and results animation remain intact.

